WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
7 of 13 people I surveyed wanted one clear suggestion a day, so Master Ronnie gives one tip.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.900
Achievements sit on your character, which shows your long-term progress.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.600
You set your daily goals and difficulty, and reaching a goal unlocks an achievement.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.900
The HP trend shows how your HP changes over time, as part of your long-term progress.
